<title>UK: Unilever sets 300 million mark five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Unilever sets 300 million mark five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNILEVER NV </p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    11.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.556   PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.806    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LON, AMST PAY FREQ    ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
